{"id":3149,"slug":"3149-websocket-trong-fastapi-implement-the-nao","category":"Python","subcategory":"FastAPI","level":"advanced","question_vi":"WebSocket trong FastAPI — implement thế nào?","question_en":"How do you implement WebSockets in FastAPI?","answer_vi":"WebSocket cho phép two-way real-time communication.\n```python\nfrom fastapi import WebSocket, WebSocketDisconnect\n\nclass ConnectionManager:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.active: list[WebSocket] = []\n\n    async def connect(self, ws: WebSocket):\n        await ws.accept(); self.active.append(ws)\n\n    def disconnect(self, ws: WebSocket):\n        self.active.remove(ws)\n\n    async def broadcast(self, msg: str):\n        for ws in self.active:\n            await ws.send_text(msg)\n\nmanager = ConnectionManager()\n\n@app.websocket(\"/ws/{client_id}\")\nasync def ws_endpoint(ws: WebSocket, client_id: str):\n    await manager.connect(ws)\n    try:\n        while True:\n            data = await ws.receive_text()\n            await manager.broadcast(f\"{client_id}: {data}\")\n    except WebSocketDisconnect:\n        manager.disconnect(ws)\n```","answer_en":"```python\n@app.websocket(\"/ws\")\nasync def ws_endpoint(ws: WebSocket):\n    await ws.accept()\n    try:\n        while True:\n            data = await ws.receive_text()\n            await ws.send_text(f\"Echo: {data}\")\n    except WebSocketDisconnect:\n        pass\n```","answer_html_vi":"<p>WebSocket cho phép two-way real-time communication.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">python</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"from fastapi import WebSocket, WebSocketDisconnect\n\nclass ConnectionManager:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.active: list[WebSocket] = []\n\n    async def connect(self, ws: WebSocket):\n        await ws.accept(); self.active.append(ws)\n\n    def disconnect(self, ws: WebSocket):\n        self.active.remove(ws)\n\n    async def broadcast(self, msg: str):\n        for ws in self.active:\n            await ws.send_text(msg)\n\nmanager = ConnectionManager()\n\n@app.websocket(&quot;/ws/{client_id}&quot;)\nasync def ws_endpoint(ws: WebSocket, client_id: str):\n    await manager.connect(ws)\n    try:\n        while True:\n            data = await ws.receive_text()\n            await manager.broadcast(f&quot;{client_id}: {data}&quot;)\n    except WebSocketDisconnect:\n        manager.disconnect(ws)\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> fastapi <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> WebSocket, WebSocketDisconnect\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ConnectionManager</span>:\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">__init__</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">self</span>):\n        <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">self</span>.active: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">list</span>[WebSocket] = []\n\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">connect</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">self, ws: WebSocket</span>):\n        <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> ws.accept(); <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">self</span>.active.append(ws)\n\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">disconnect</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">self, ws: WebSocket</span>):\n        <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">self</span>.active.remove(ws)\n\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">broadcast</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">self, msg: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">str</span></span>):\n        <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">for</span> ws <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">self</span>.active:\n            <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> ws.send_text(msg)\n\nmanager = ConnectionManager()\n\n<span class=\"hljs-meta\">@app.websocket(<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;/ws/{client_id}&quot;</span></span>)</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">ws_endpoint</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">ws: WebSocket, client_id: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">str</span></span>):\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> manager.connect(ws)\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">try</span>:\n        <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">while</span> <span class=\"hljs-literal\">True</span>:\n            data = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> ws.receive_text()\n            <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> manager.broadcast(<span class=\"hljs-string\">f&quot;<span class=\"hljs-subst\">{client_id}</span>: <span class=\"hljs-subst\">{data}</span>&quot;</span>)\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">except</span> WebSocketDisconnect:\n        manager.disconnect(ws)</code></pre></div>","answer_html_en":"<div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">python</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"@app.websocket(&quot;/ws&quot;)\nasync def ws_endpoint(ws: WebSocket):\n    await ws.accept()\n    try:\n        while True:\n            data = await ws.receive_text()\n            await ws.send_text(f&quot;Echo: {data}&quot;)\n    except WebSocketDisconnect:\n        pass\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-meta\">@app.websocket(<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;/ws&quot;</span></span>)</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">ws_endpoint</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">ws: WebSocket</span>):\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> ws.accept()\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">try</span>:\n        <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">while</span> <span class=\"hljs-literal\">True</span>:\n            data = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> ws.receive_text()\n            <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> ws.send_text(<span class=\"hljs-string\">f&quot;Echo: <span class=\"hljs-subst\">{data}</span>&quot;</span>)\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">except</span> WebSocketDisconnect:\n        <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">pass</span></code></pre></div>","references":[],"related":[{"url":"/q/3101-python-quan-ly-bo-nho-nhu-the-nao","title":"Python quản lý bộ nhớ như thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/3102-mutable-vs-immutable-types-trong-python","title":"Mutable vs Immutable types trong Python?"},{"url":"/q/3103-list-tuple-set-dict-khi-nao-dung-cai-nao","title":"`list`, `tuple`, `set`, `dict` — khi nào dùng cái nào?"},{"url":"/q/3104-generator-va-yield-la-gi-tai-sao-dung","title":"Generator và `yield` là gì? Tại sao dùng?"},{"url":"/q/3105-decorator-la-gi-viet-decorator-don-gian","title":"Decorator là gì? Viết decorator đơn giản."},{"url":"/q/3106-context-manager-va-with-statement-hoat-dong-the-nao","title":"Context Manager và `with` statement hoạt động thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/3108-closure-la-gi-khac-voi-lambda-the-nao","title":"Closure là gì? Khác với lambda thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/3109-shallow-copy-vs-deep-copy-khac-nhau-the-nao","title":"Shallow copy vs Deep copy — khác nhau thế nào?"}]}